sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant App as Next.js App
    participant NA as NextAuth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Email as Brevo Email

    Note over U,Email: Email + Password Registration
    U->>App: POST /api/auth/register
    App->>App: Validate input (Zod)
    App->>DB: Check email exists
    DB-->>App: Not found
    App->>App: Hash password (bcrypt)
    App->>DB: Create User + EmailVerification token
    App->>Email: Send verification email
    App-->>U: 201 Created

    Note over U,Email: Email Verification
    U->>App: GET /verify-email?token=xyz
    App->>DB: Validate token (not expired)
    App->>DB: Mark email verified
    App-->>U: Redirect to /dashboard

    Note over U,Email: OAuth Login (GitHub)
    U->>App: Click "Login with GitHub"
    App->>NA: Initiate OAuth flow
    NA->>U: Redirect to GitHub
    U->>NA: Authorize app
    NA->>DB: Find or create User + Account
    NA->>DB: Create Session
    NA-->>U: Set cookie + redirect /dashboard
